      "width": 0.02422528832308362,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "日の歩行者数はほかの土曜日より38%多く、来",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.13052268951930246,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.6586596602295066,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場者",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.13052268951930246,
      "left": 0.798766855668203,
      "width": 0.061604824336805246,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "の4人に3人が近所の別の店にも立ち寄ったと答え",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16474733318851373,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.720793309763599,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "た。県立大学の経済学者である白井教授は、これを",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2004600048433428,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7207846026571231,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「波及効果」と呼んでいる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23468464851255397,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.3951910316305391,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "もちろん、良いことばかりではない。出店料は今",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.27039732016738305,
      "left": 0.18235483192896504,
      "width": 0.6780052765156941,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年1月に1日3,500円から5,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.30462196383659434,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.37888882300424337,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "000円に値上げされ、古",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.30462196383659434,
      "left": 0.5184721362863104,
      "width": 0.3418889914872797,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "くからの店主の中には負担が重いと話す人も",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3403346354914234,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.6266599935604096,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "いる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3403346354914234,
      "left": 0.7670777549628577,
      "width": 0.09329017521162639,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "最も多い苦情は駐車場だ。最寄りの公共駐車場は",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3745592791606346,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7207767815522702,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "220台分しかなく、たいてい午前9時15分には満車",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.41027195081546375,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7207884793569125,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "になる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.44449659448467493,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.1221610741209284,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市議会は、5月1日から10月31日まで、さらに2",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4802092661395041,
      "left": 0.18235483192896504,
      "width": 0.6780155836034186,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ブロックを車両通行止めにする案を検討している。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5144339098087153,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7207903873956778,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "賛成派は40店分のス",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5501465814635444,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.2907457802325547,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ペースが増えると主張し、反対",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5501465814635444,
      "left": 0.42945898929845144,
      "width": 0.43091205427698714,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "派は配送や高齢者の移動への影響を心配している。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5843712251327556,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7207750003827711,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "最近はQRコードで支払う若い客も増えた。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6200838967875846,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.5969094958635301,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "今のところ、いつもの光景は変わらない。正午に",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.654308540456796,
      "left": 0.18235483192896504,
      "width": 0.6780052765156941,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "はパンが売り切れ、花のバケツは半分空になり、噴",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6900212121116249,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7207798339143162,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "水のそばではブラスバンド(退職した教",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7242458557808361,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.5486062612540523,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "師5人組で、",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7242458557808361,
      "left": 0.6882135949093556,
      "width": 0.17215414173220855,
      "height": 0.02181448997155253
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「セカンドウィンド」と名乗",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7584704994500475,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.40936304132486967,
      "height": 0.0218144899715525
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "っている)が演",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7584704994500475,
      "left": 0.5499746441748499,
      "width": 0.2175083975395363,
      "height": 0.0218144899715525
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "奏して",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7584704994500475,
      "left": 0.7685113170470051,
      "width": 0.091845106147545,
      "height": 0.0218144899715525
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "いる。午後2時には、トラックは再び荷物でいっぱ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7941831711048765,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7207909602864516,
      "height": 0.0218144899715525
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "いになる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8284078147740876,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.15270133633217528,
      "height": 0.0218144899715525
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
